WEBVTT

00:00:59.507 --> 00:01:02.466
They spray-painted my name
and my family's name

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:06.020
with unspeakable profanities
across our front gate

00:01:06.044 --> 00:01:07.836
and around our neighborhood.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:12.466
And they felt that my father,
who was a strict man of tradition,

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:13.780
would stop me.

00:01:14.168 --> 00:01:17.318
Instead, my father stood
in front of me and said,

00:01:17.342 --> 00:01:20.019
"If you speak the truth,
I will stand with you,

00:01:20.043 --> 00:01:21.470
and so will the world."

00:01:21.494 --> 00:01:22.670
And then he got --

00:01:22.694 --> 00:01:27.757
(Applause)

00:01:27.781 --> 00:01:31.550
And then he got a group of people together
and they whitewashed the walls.